## Gate scripts

All emit exactly one JSON line. `"error_kind"` means the environment is wrong,
not the game.

```
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-runner-godot.sh [--export]
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-sim-godot.sh --replay --seed 4242
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-sim-godot.sh --balance --seeds 20
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-asset-validate.sh --image <path> --tier <A|B>
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-style-lock.sh --lock | --verify
{{AGENT_DIR}}/scripts/{{PREFIX}}-visual-godot.sh --all
```

Environment: `GODOT_BIN` pins the engine; `GP_PYTHON` pins the interpreter used
for image analysis (needs Pillow); `GEMINI_API_KEY` enables scripted generation;
`GP_ART_PROVIDER` overrides the provider.

Invoke gate scripts through `bash`. Inspect the JSON `pass` field; the process
exit code is only a transport signal. Read cross-session memory from
`{{MEMORY_PATH}}/MEMORY.md` when present; append new entries without rewriting it.

